      "tactic_notes": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><!--{cke_protected}{C}%3C!%2D%2D%20x-tinymce%2Fhtml%20%2D%2D%3E--><strong>Pavel(17)</strong></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>【Lumberjack】</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">A Youngster from the village, he and his sister Petra are the child of a famous woodworker \"Petro\" Though ever since the Lumina Revolution, the empire has find little need for wood, so their father moved to Lesminir where people appreciate his vintage works more.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>【Character Notes】</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<ul style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<li><strong>Lesnimir Youth</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Mikhail, Vila, Pavel and Petra are all childhood friend and youths who grew up alongside each other in Lesnimir. They enjoy playing and the company of each other.</p>\n<hr>\n<ul style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<li><strong>Scaredy Cat</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Pavel get scared easily and is a coward at heart, he believes story of ghost and monsters, and he believes the story of Witches that adults of the empire told their children</p>\n<hr>\n<ul style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<li><strong>Fear and Paranoia</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Pavel is the person who outed Vila as being a Witch, as he witness Vila using magic to defeat a monster when him and Mikhail and Vila were out gathering materials in Lesnistrom Forest. Though he didn't know that Vila use magic to protect Mikhail from monster. Now he fears that the Vila would actually curse him for exposing her and scare that she would come for revenge. Because of this, he has refuse to leave the village despite being in charge of material gathering.</p>\n<hr>\n<ul style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<li><strong>Caring Friend</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">​​​​​​​Pavel is genuinely concern for Mikhail after the incident, knowing that his friend wish to help Vila despite knowing that she is a witch, Pavel wrongfully believes that it is Vila using her magic to control Mikhail somehow. Despite showing concern, he doesn't have the courage to acts on it fearing that it would anger the Witch.</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>【Favourite Food】</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Potato Pierogi:</strong> These traditional dumplings are filled with mashed potatoes, seasoned with herbs and spices, then boiled or fried until golden.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>【View on Magic】</strong></p>\n<p>As a paranoia gullible youth, Pavel has strong belief in the empire propaganda. Beliving that Magic is evil.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>【Sample Dialog】</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">💬\"Ah!, Don't scare me like that! I'm Pavel, a lumberjack, my job here is to gathered material like woods and stuff, I guess?\"</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">💬 \"I... I heard something in the woods last night, Petra. I swear it was the ghost of Vila, wandering in the darkness. We should stay away from there!\"</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">💬 \"Mikhail, do you really think it's safe to talk about Vila? What if she hears us? I don't want to end up hexed or cursed or... worse.\"</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">💬 \"Mikhail, I'm worried about you. Vila, she's... she's not right. Her magic, it's got you tangled somehow. We should stay away from her, for our own safety!\"</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\" data-cke-filler-webkit=\"end\" data-cke-temp=\"1\">&nbsp;</div>",
